orted, its error printed."] [248 1 "// localState is a _local's per-thread dicts and its constructor's arguments (localobject)."] [257 1 "// localDict makes o's dict the running thread's, made (and __init__ called again, as CPython's"] [258 1 "// _ldict) on the thread's first access."] [703 4 "// PyErr_SetInterruptEx: only a Python handler is tripped; on the main thread it runs at once (CPython's"] [704 4 "// next eval breaker check is at the call's return)"] [711 3 "// set_name and _get_name: the thread's name as pthread_setname_np keeps it on Linux, encoded in utf-8,"] [712 3 "// cut at a NUL and at _NAME_MAXLEN (15) bytes, read back by os.fsdecode's rule"]] :go/pos {:name [1 9] :package [1 1]} :go/semis [[103 34] [174 34] [175 29] [198 51] [213 101] [214 37] [215 48] [242 32] [269 21] [279 56] [280 70] [415 40] [434 50] [600 38] [681 34] [705 26] [737 43]]} (go/file "builtins_thread.go" :imports [


